#: crates/mc-ui/src/perf/mem_composition.rs:74
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Other ({})\n"
"\n"
"Programs, kernel and other memory outside Cache, Shared and Buff. All four "
"non-free sections together equal physically occupied RAM (MemTotal minus "
"MemFree), not the primary In use value. MemAvailable is an estimate, not a "
"section of this bar."
msgstr ""

#: crates/mc-ui/src/perf/mem_composition.rs:80
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Cache ({})\n"
"\n"
"File cache excluding Shared, plus reclaimable slab: max(Cached - Shmem, 0) + "
"SReclaimable. This is not the raw Cached counter."
msgstr ""

#: crates/mc-ui/src/perf/mem_composition.rs:86
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Shared ({})\n"
"\n"
"Shared memory (Shmem), including tmpfs. Counted separately from Cache."
msgstr ""

#: crates/mc-ui/src/perf/mem_composition.rs:91
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Buff ({})\n"
"\n"
"Kernel buffers (Buffers), accounted for separately from Cache."
msgstr ""

#: crates/mc-ui/src/perf/mem_composition.rs:96
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Free ({})\n"
"\n"
"Unoccupied physical memory (MemFree). Cache, including ZFS ARC, is not free "
"memory."
msgstr ""

#: crates/mc-ui/src/perf/mem_composition.rs:103
msgid ""
"Adjusted counters: Cached below Shmem is treated as zero before adding "
"SReclaimable; overflow is saturated; Free, Shared, Buff, then Cache are "
"limited to remaining total memory. Values shown are the displayed partition."
msgstr ""

